+The rebuilt provider passes 27 actual-bytecode SQLite assertions (including 600 concurrent distinct rows), 37 native NeoForge 21.1.248 logging/rollback/commerce assertions and eight clean-restart assertions. Tests and exact source/artifact/fixture evidence are maintained in the parent Citizens repository under tools/grieflogger-compat and docs/grieflogger-write-recovery-validation-2026-10-23.json. The original failed artifact-only reproducer is retained there.
