+No production activation. Pending writes remain in memory; unflushed process termination, full-device failure, uncertain-outcome administration, retention/capacity/load and MySQL acceptance remain separate work. Native event payloads, SQL schemas, components and financial ownership are not rewritten to satisfy tests.
